# packages.host — WHY-commented, curated for 4GB/32GB (ch.05 §8, low-spec §4)
# Each line: package # WHY (PSS cost or gate). New daemon must show PSS or CI fails.

systemd # PID1, required
udev # device nodes for binder/ashmem/graphics
network-manager # owns Wi-Fi/LTE single-stack (FR-04)
modemmanager # host owns modem (ch.07 §1)
pipewire # single audio server (FR-05)
wireplumber # pipewire session policy
phosh # primary home, ≤450MB idle budget
phoc # compositor
feedbackd # haptics for permission/call alerts (a11y)
lxc # Android container runtime
cryptsetup # LUKS2 userdata (AES-256-XTS)
veritysetup # dm-verity strict
tpm2-tools # reserved, no daemon by default (keep PSS low)
# NO: full GNOME, tracker-miners, cups, snapd — each breaks 4GB budget, needs Arch sign
